{"uuid": "cc713d16-b781-485f-a474-7757d76f4feb", "message": "1000101000100010101100010101000011011100011110110101001111010011", "container": "Space exploration has its own set of advantages and disadvantages. On one hand, it allows us to discover new frontiers and expand our knowledge of the universe. It also brings about technological advancements, leading to innovations in various sectors. Furthermore, space exploration can inspire future generations and foster international collaboration. However, it comes with significant costs, both monetary and in terms of human lives. Additionally, the resources allocated to space exploration could be used for other pressing issues on Earth. Moreover, space debris poses a threat to satellites and spacecraft. In conclusion, while space exploration has its merits, careful consideration must be given to its drawbacks. (104 words)", "encoded_message": "Cosmic research contains its specific array of benefits and drawbacks. Upon one side, it enables us to find novel boundaries and extend our understanding of the cosmos. It additionally produces with scientific progress, spurring to breakthroughs in several fields. Moreover, outer space exploration can stimulate prospective groups and encourage global cooperation. However, it arrives with considerable expenses, both financial and in terms of human lives. Additionally, the resources allocated to space exploration could be used for other pressing issues on Earth. Moreover, space debris poses a threat to satellites and spacecraft. In conclusion, while space exploration has its merits, careful consideration must be given to its drawbacks. 104 words", "secret_key": [{"Space": {"00": "Extraterrestrial", "01": "Interstellar", "10": "Cosmic", "11": "Celestial"}}, {"exploration": {"00": "research", "01": "investigation", "10": "prospection", "11": "examination"}}, {"has": {"00": "possesses", "01": "features", "10": "contains", "11": "holds"}}, {"its": {"0": "its", "1": "its"}}, {"own": {"00"